\section{Step-wise Checkpoint Analysis for \texorpdfstring{$\lambda = 0.1$}{lambda = 0.1}}
\label{sec:appendix_stepwise}

Table~\ref{tab:stepwise_lambda01} reports per-seed CAR at three intermediate checkpoints for $\lambda = 0.1$. The seed-averaged curve shows no monotonic trend, confirming that SDF loss weight does not produce a progressive training signal.

